<div>
    <p>A row per social link (footer icons, "Follow us"), optionally tagged with a <code>platform</code> and <code>sync_posts</code> to also pull that platform's recent posts into <code>social_posts</code> (a plain cache table, not its own admin module — like <code>OrderProduct</code>/<code>BonusTransaction</code>, nothing hand-edits a row).</p>
    <p>Facebook/Instagram/TikTok need a one-time OAuth authorization: trigger it via <code>POST /admin/social-network/{id}/authorize</code> (redirects to the provider) or the <code>php artisan {facebook,instagram,tiktok}:authorize</code> commands. Facebook's page token lives in cache (1 year TTL); Instagram/TikTok's in the <code>social_tokens</code> table with real refresh support. Telegram/YouTube need no OAuth — just a bot token / API key in <code>config/services.php</code>.</p>
    <p>Schedule <code>php artisan social-posts:sync</code> (dispatches one queued job per platform with <code>sync_posts</code> on) and <code>php artisan social-tokens:refresh</code> (Instagram/Facebook) periodically — neither runs automatically. Synced posts are readable at <code>GET /api/social/posts</code> (guest-allowed, optional <code>?platform=</code> filter).</p>
</div>
